          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 58912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa rende <code>&lt;img&gt;</code> un tag vuoto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non ha alcun tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non ha attributi</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Non c'è <code>/</code> nel suo tag di apertura</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non ha alcun tag di chiusura.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi <code>&lt;img src=\"photo.png\"&gt;</code>. Che cosa lo rende comunque un tag vuoto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Non ha alcun tag di chiusura</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ha un attributo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ha un nome di file tra virgolette</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Non ha alcun tag di chiusura.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 58913,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quante immagini appariranno in questa pagina web?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/dog.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/cat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">2</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere 2.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa vedrà il visitatore dopo il rendering di questo codice HTML?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/dog.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/cat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Due immagini, una per ogni indirizzo src</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo la seconda immagine, perché sostituisce la prima</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I due indirizzi delle immagini sotto forma di testo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Due immagini, una per ogni indirizzo src.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 58914,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo regolare l'altezza di un'immagine?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Con l'attributo <code>height</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Con il tag <code>&lt;height&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Con l'attributo <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un'immagine è troppo alta. Quale codice ne modifica l'altezza?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'attributo <code>height</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il tag <code>&lt;height&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere L'attributo <code>height</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 58915,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale attributo dobbiamo impostare per il tag <code>img</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">L'attributo <code>src</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'attributo <code>href</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">L'attributo <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>&lt;img src=\"cat.png\"&gt;</code>, quale parte indica al browser dove trovare l'immagine?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>src</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>href</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>img</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>src</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 58917,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imposta l'attributo <code>width</code> dell'immagine su <code>\"200\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/cat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;width&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>width</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'attributo <code>width</code> imposta la larghezza dell'immagine; <code>height</code> ne imposta l'altezza. Entrambi usano i pixel di default.</p><p>Usa l'attributo <code>width</code> per impostare la larghezza dell'immagine del gatto su <code>200</code> pixel.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.app/i/cat.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"height\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;width&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>width</code>, seguito da <code>=</code> e infine <code>\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 58919,
